<figure class="recovery" aria-labelledby="recovery-title"><figcaption id="recovery-title">Figure 1 · Restore the target, then account for B203</figcaption><div class="paper-surface scene"><div class="history"><span>Full backup</span><span>Target T</span><span>Mistake</span><span>B203</span><span>Increment</span><span>Fence</span></div><div class="copies"><div class="copy"><p class="copy-label"><strong>Old source</strong></p><p data-live data-source></p></div><div class="copy"><p class="copy-label"><strong>Candidate</strong></p><p data-live data-candidate></p></div></div><p data-live data-explanation aria-live="polite"></p></div><div class="transport" role="group" aria-label="Recovery illustration controls"><button data-play>Play</button><button data-back>Back</button><button data-next>Next</button><button data-reset>Reset</button><span data-step></span></div><div data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div><details><summary>Recovery as text</summary><ol><li>The saved chain includes history on both sides of target T.</li><li>The old source closes admission and resolves the request racing that fence.</li><li>The restored candidate has capacity 3, remaining 3 and no B203.</li><li>Reconcile B203 and one decrement atomically: remaining 2.</li><li>Repeat the same request identity: existing outcome, remaining 2.</li><li>Accept data and external effects before transferring write authority.</li></ol></details><p class="caption">Conceptual history. T is the actual pre-mistake database timestamp selected in the native drill; the scenario's 11:00 and 11:05 labels are not measured commit times. This illustration does not run CockroachDB.</p></figure>
<script>
import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
const root=document.querySelector('.recovery');const stages=[
['Serving; B203 exists; remaining 2','Not restored','The full backup and its increment cover T. The increment also includes the later mistake and B203; choosing T will exclude both.'],
['Fenced; all admission outcomes resolved','Isolated','Close source writes before enumerating excluded valid requests. B203 is accepted; the request racing the fence is rejected.'],
['Fenced and stopped','Capacity 3 · remaining 3 · B203 absent','Restore as of T. The wrong capacity increase is absent, but the later valid booking is absent too. A restored server is not yet the recovered service.'],
['Fenced','Capacity 3 · remaining 2 · one B203','One transaction inserts B203, consumes one place and records its request identity and fingerprint.'],
['Fenced','Capacity 3 · remaining 2 · one B203','The repeated identity returns the stored outcome. No second decrement is applied; a different payload under the same identity is a conflict.'],
['Fenced; no return to writes','Accepted; ready for authority transfer','Check the capacity equation and external authorities before admitting new requests. Keep the old history closed throughout.']];
if(root)stepper(root,{steps:()=>stages.length,draw:i=>{root.querySelector('[data-source]').textContent=stages[i][0];root.querySelector('[data-candidate]').textContent=stages[i][1];root.querySelector('[data-explanation]').textContent=stages[i][2];}});
</script>
<style>
.recovery{margin:2.5rem 0}.recovery figcaption{font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.7rem}.scene{padding:1rem}.history{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.3rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--teal);padding-bottom:.8rem}.history span{font-size:.8rem}.copies{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.8rem;margin:1rem 0}.copies .copy{border:1px solid var(--color-text);padding:.7rem}.copies .copy-label{font-size:1rem;margin:0;min-height:0}.copies p{font-size:.95rem;min-height:4em}.transport{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;align-items:center;margin:.8rem 0}.transport button{font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:transparent;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:.25rem;padding:.5rem .75rem;cursor:pointer}.transport button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal);outline-offset:2px}.transport [aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.55}[data-hold]{height:3px}[data-hold] span{height:100%;display:block;width:0;background:var(--teal)}.caption{font-size:.9rem}.recovery details{margin:.8rem 0}@media(max-width:500px){.copies{grid-template-columns:1fr}.copies p{min-height:2em}.history{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));row-gap:.7rem}}
</style>
